SUMMARY:The Mystical Art of Nicomedes Gómez II: The Sator Magic Square
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nJoin us as we explore th
 e detailed symbolism of the painting *The Sator Magic Square* by the belov
 ed Rosicrucian artist Nicomedes Gómez. Our guide\, Hugh McCague\, will dr
 aw out for us many mystical and Rosicrucian laws and principles applied an
 d depicted in this artwork of great harmony\, profound insight\, and inspi
 ration that resonate deeply within the student of mysticism.\n\n**Please R
 SVP to access log-in information. Click ATTEND ONLINE below.**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/amorc-santa-rosa-pronaos/events/31547
 7783/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260629T235359Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629T235359Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
