SUMMARY:The Law of Love
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nTopic:\n**The Law of Lov
 e**\n**Atrium Group Ritual presented by Frank Nappi\, F.R.C.**\n\nAll AMOR
 C members\, their families and friends of the Rosicrucian Order are welcom
 e to attend. We are delighted to have you join us in ritual and discussion
 .\n\n• Important to know- Doors open for members and non-member friends 
 of the Rosicrucian Order by 6:30 PM. Please arrive early! The Atrium Group
  ritual begins promptly at 7:00 PM. Members - please bring your credential
 s or membership dues receipt.\n\nFollowing the meeting:\n1st Tuesday- Myst
 ical Seekers Series Public Presentation at 8:00 PM\n\nThe Santa Rosa Prona
 os operates under the law of AMRA. You may give as your heart and mind dir
 ect you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational non-profit\, an 
 affiliated body of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge for the Americas an
 d the Caribbean.
