SUMMARY:Practicing the Principles
DESCRIPTION:Rosicrucians AMORC\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nTopic:\n**Practicing the
  Principles**\n**Pronaos convocation for AMORC members only**\n**with Pron
 aos Master\, Frank Nappi\, F.R.C.**\n\nAll current Rosicrucian members of 
 AMORC are invited to join us for this inspiring Pronaos convocation and di
 scussion.\n\n• Important to know- Doors open for members of the Rosicruc
 ian Order by 6:30 PM. Please arrive early! The Pronaos ritual begins promp
 tly at 7:00 PM. Members - please bring your Active membership credentials 
 or active membership dues receipt.\n\nFollowing the meeting:\n1st Tuesday-
  Mystical Seekers Series Public Presentation at 8:00 PM\n\nThe Santa Rosa 
 Pronaos operates under the law of AMRA. You may give as your heart and min
 d direct you.\n\nThe Santa Rosa Pronaos is a 501c3 educational non-profit\
 , an affiliated body of the Rosicrucian English Grand Lodge for the Americ
 as and the Caribbean.
